      "writtenOn": "2026-11-06T09:37:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We modified this to replace the hardcoded Name: nfs-ganesha with the native %{name} macro evaluation.\nBy adding the conditional fallback %{!?name: %global name nfs-ganesha}, it safely defaults back to the original name if nothing is passed, so standard builds won\u0027t break.\nThis change is necessary because it allows us to dynamically pass a custom package name prefix during compilation, such as:\n--define \"name \u003cfsal\u003e-nfs-ganesha\"",
      "parentUuid": "9a4152a1_6885b6c0",
      "revId": "9ace425c67a89af5c7c64d0df0a3e902ba14c817",
